{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ef631293-6ae1-87f9-bc32-be5578231220",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T10:39:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maureen Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:37:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:37:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise. Well, I'm calling to report that the city tried to kill me, but it was only the sidewalk, so no big deal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Okay, tell me what happened. Are you hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I'm fine, a scraped palm and some wounded pride. The sidewalk has heaved up, one slab is sitting higher than the next, and I tripped on the edge of it this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, glad you're okay. Where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:37:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in front of 25 Bacheller Street, in the Fifth Ward. Right along the front of the house there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:37:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-five Bacheller. And how big a problem are we talking about? How big is the raised part?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole lifted section is about two feet across. The one edge is sticking up maybe a couple inches, and with the rain washing over everything today you can't really see it until your toe finds it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:38:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. With the snow and then the rain coming through, the ground has been moving around. I'll put in a sidewalk report for that spot and it goes to the crew supervisors."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:38:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. Can I get a reference number for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:38:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hang on a second, let me get it entered. [pause] Okay, your reference number is PW-2 6-0 1 1 7. I'll say it again, PW, two six, zero one one seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW, two six, zero one one seven. Got it, writing it on my hand, since I'm on the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:38:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do you want a call back when somebody has looked at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:38:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, you can reach me at 401-555-0152."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0152. I've got it noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. You know, it's funny, people used to just walk into City Hall and tell somebody about this stuff instead of calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They still can, but the phone works too. I can't promise a day for the repair, crews are busy after this storm, but it's in the system now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:39:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all I needed. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care of that hand."
    }
  ],
